    "title": "Teenage suspect in DeLand double murder is arrested in Ellenton; motive unclear - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Jim DeLa ,\n11 hours ago SARASOTA, Fla. (WWSB) - A 17-year-old suspected in a double murder in Volusia County has been arrested in Ellenton, the U.S. Marshals Service said Wednesday. The teenager was wanted for two counts of second-degree murder in the July 29 shooting deaths of Samson Campbell, 18, and Dustin Rose, 19 in DeLand. Read full article\n5",
